      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Step 2: Using Heron's formula, the area \\(K\\) of triangle \\(ABC\\) is:\n\\[ K = \\sqrt{s(s - AB)(s - AC)(s - BC)} = \\sqrt{20(20 - 17)(20 - 8)(20 - 15)} = \\sqrt{20 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 12 \\cdot 5} = \\sqrt{3600} = 60 \\]",
